This is the cumulative record of every release scope named in the repository
licensing map. Its entries are append-only; a later release or license change
does not remove an earlier dedication. A machine-readable ledger for this map
and the shared notice is kept in config/licensing/cc0-release-scopes.json.

Those notices also cover the project-owned shared runtime incorporated into the
named releases. A version-specific dedication does not automatically apply to
later releases, later contributions, or newly added gadgets.

